{
  "an3.126:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.126 ",
  "an3.126:0.2": "13. Kusināravagga ",
  "an3.126:0.3": "Bharaṇḍukālāmasutta ",
  "an3.126:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kosalesu cārikaṁ caramāno yena kapilavatthu tadavasari. ",
  "an3.126:1.2": "Assosi kho mahānāmo sakko: “bhagavā kira kapilavatthuṁ anuppatto”ti. ",
  "an3.126:1.3": "Atha kho mahānāmo sakko yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ aṭṭhāsi. Ekamantaṁ ṭhitaṁ kho mahānāmaṁ sakkaṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "an3.126:2.1": "“Gaccha, mahānāma, kapilavatthusmiṁ, tathārūpaṁ āvasathaṁ jāna yatthajja mayaṁ ekarattiṁ vihareyyāmā”ti. ",
  "an3.126:2.2": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho mahānāmo sakko bhagavato paṭissutvā kapilavatthuṁ pavisitvā kevalakappaṁ kapilavatthuṁ anvāhiṇḍanto nāddasa kapilavatthusmiṁ tathārūpaṁ āvasathaṁ yatthajja bhagavā ekarattiṁ vihareyya. ",
  "an3.126:3.1": "Atha kho mahānāmo sakko yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an3.126:3.2": "“natthi, bhante, kapilavatthusmiṁ tathārūpo āvasatho yatthajja bhagavā ekarattiṁ vihareyya. ",
  "an3.126:3.3": "Ayaṁ, bhante, bharaṇḍu kālāmo bhagavato purāṇasabrahmacārī. ",
  "an3.126:3.4": "Tassajja bhagavā assame ekarattiṁ viharatū”ti. ",
  "an3.126:3.5": "“Gaccha, mahānāma, santharaṁ paññāpehī”ti. ",
  "an3.126:3.6": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho mahānāmo sakko bhagavato paṭ